WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:04.480
Regarding the Wutu's commander Shilang this time do you know anything about him?

00:04.560 --> 00:10.600
Heard from General Zu this man is one of Wutu Zhao's renowned fierce generals when Yong'an fell that year.

00:10.680 --> 00:16.600
He led only dozens of cavalry charged into the city single-handedly made tens of thousands of defenders tremble and flee.

00:16.800 --> 00:22.840
In recent years he has had few defeats however this Shilang despite this with illustrious military achievements.

00:22.920 --> 00:29.200
Now is only a Left General all because his mother was a captured Xuan woman slave.

00:29.400 --> 00:35.000
Making his origins lowly in the Wutu Zhao court he is suppressed everywhere that can only make him.

00:35.080 --> 00:39.680
More cunning because he cannot afford mistakes.

